Breath Taker ~ Steal Air	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural.Attack	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:A ghostly incorporeal hand with 10 ft. reach plunges into the chest of a creature hit by its incorporeal touch: Fortitude save (Charisma-based) or 1d4 Con damage and fatigued; maintained each round as a move action, the victim falls unconscious, then dying, then dead on further failed saves (base creature: Dead Man's Chest p.79).	SOURCEPAGE:p.54
